<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanjin Heavy '96 net profit plunges.</title>
<headline>Hanjin Heavy '96 net profit plunges.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				    3.2   vs	  13.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net			  4.6   vs	  14.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			   600.5   vs	 541.8</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss (million) 617.0   vs	 796.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Hanjin Heavy Industries Co, an affiliate of the Hanjin Group, said its 1996 share capital rose to 36.52 million, from 26.52 million shares in 1995. No futher details were given.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
